        },
        {
          "text": "Bavuga ibitumbaganyemw’ ibitagira ico bimaze, basukasuka abariko baridohora mu bagenda bazimiye, babasukasukisha ukwifuza kw’umubiri n’isoni nke. ",
          "type": "text",
