              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namba kumenya neza Yesu Kristo Umwami wacu n’Umukiza kwarabateye kudohoka, bakava mu vy’ isi bihumanya, maze bakongera kuvyizingiramwo, bikabanesha, ivyo hanyuma vyabo birusha ivya mbere kuba bibi. ",
          "type": "text",
